rovements (if you want to continue this workflow)\n- Add a stronger fallback chain for “stocks to watch” macro/reco items to reduce “non disponible” cases.\n- Harmonize timestamp/reference timing across sources to reduce occasional quote discrepancies.\n- Standardize Telegram topic routing pattern for future cron jobs to avoid first-attempt format errors.\n\n---\n\n## 5) Important context to remember\n\n- **Hard constraint:** Yahoo must never be the only source.\n- **Required output style:** emojis + bullet points, no markdown table.\n- **Missing-data policy:** always show “non disponible” + attempted source.\n- **Delivery destination used successfully:** Telegram chat `-1003791371950`, topic/thread `3`.\n- **Operational note:** In this environment, topic posting worked with `target=<chatId>` + `threadId=<topicId>` (not `chatId:topicId` in `target`).\n- **Session behavior requirement met:** after tool-based message delivery, assistant correctly returned `NO_REPLY`.","textSignature":"msg_0cb107790609d01401698fa53258748191b5fa62b6636282d0"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":357,"output":819,"cacheRead":24320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25496,"cost":{"input":0.00062475,"output":0.011466,"cacheRead":0.004256,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01634675}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771021615899}}
